          "i2": "use of the Service in breach of these Terms, including while driving, without line of sight of the entrance, or with a safety device disabled;",
          "i3": "automatic features, event schedules and override modes, and any opening, closing or holding that results from them;",
          "i4": "access granted, shared, not revoked or obtained with a lost or unprotected QR label, phone, invitation or guest pass;",
          "i5": "unauthorised entry, burglary, theft, vandalism, damage to vehicles or property, being locked in or out, or loss of access;",
