        "b0": "You may stop using the Service and delete your account at any time. We may suspend or terminate your access if you breach these Terms or if we are required to do so by law.",
        "b1": "A Controller continues to operate locally after an account is deleted; its Owner and Administrators remain responsible for it and for the data stored on it. Sections that by their nature should survive termination, including sections 3, 4, 6, 11, 16 and 18 to 25, survive."
