        "b0": "We release updates to the app and firmware to fix problems, improve security and add features. A firmware update is installed only after an Administrator confirms it, and a Controller that fails to start the new firmware returns to the previous version. Keeping the app and Controllers up to date may be necessary for security and for some features to work; we are not responsible for problems caused by not installing an update."
