        "b0": "These Terms and our Privacy Policy are the entire agreement between you and us about the Service. A Controller's sales documents govern its sale and hardware warranty; in any other matter these Terms prevail.",
        "b1": "If a provision of these Terms is found unenforceable, it will be enforced to the maximum extent permitted and the rest remains in effect. Our failure to enforce a provision is not a waiver. You may not transfer your rights under these Terms without our consent; we may transfer ours to a successor of our business. Nothing in these Terms creates a partnership, agency or employment relationship.",
        "b2": "We may send you notices in the app, by email or on the website. These Terms are published in English and Hebrew and may be shown in English on pages in other languages. If versions differ, the English version prevails."
