          "i2": "Operate an entrance only when you can see it and its entire path of movement, and only after making sure that no person, child, animal, vehicle or object is in that path.",
          "i3": "Never pass through, or let anyone pass through, an entrance while it is moving, and never let children operate the Service or play near an entrance.",
          "i4": "Stop using the Service and inform the Owner or Administrator immediately if the Supported Equipment behaves abnormally, does not stop or reverse at an obstacle, or a safety device is damaged.",
          "i5": "Comply with the rules of the property and the instructions of the Owner and Administrator."
