        "b1": "Do not rely on WIFIGATE as the only means of securing a property or as the only means of entry or exit. An independent means of operation, such as a key, keypad or manual release, must always remain available, including for emergency services and in case of a power, phone, battery or Bluetooth failure. WIFIGATE must not be configured or used in a way that could prevent or delay emergency exit or the access of emergency services."
